  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The value of the resistance of a carbon resistor having the standard colour-coding as shown in the figure is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo><mi>G&#937;</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. What is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>?</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0629616.jpg\" style=\"width: 274px; height: 188px;\" />&nbsp;</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
